+# method-agnostic: one-hot target_probs onto the next token of the fixed
+# 6-token harmony final-channel-open boundary once cumulative real emitted
+# tokens cross a threshold without that boundary having occurred naturally,
+# applied BEFORE this method's own relaxation math reads target_probs so it
+# flows through whatever this method does with it. spec-casc-opt switches between strict-test and always-accept via a TV-based defer_mask; OR force_commit_mask into it below so a forced position always takes the strict branch. Own alpha-knob file (not spec-casc-opt's plain one) to avoid the same cross-patch alpha-aliasing bug class spec-casc-tok-force-commit's own module comment documents.
+_SPEC_CASC_OPT_FORCE_COMMIT_THRESHOLD_FILE = f"/tmp/lossy-token-eff-spec-casc-opt-force-commit-threshold-{os.getuid()}"
+try:
+    with open(_SPEC_CASC_OPT_FORCE_COMMIT_THRESHOLD_FILE) as _f:
